      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'MEDICAL REFERENCE GUIDE



    This book contains information about

    symptoms,
    conditions, chemical compounds,

    and medicines.



    HOW TO USE THIS BOOK



    1.
    Examine the patient''s clipboard.



    2. Go to the Symptoms page and select

    the
    symptoms you observed.



    3. Go to the Conditions page to see

    the possible
    condition.



    4. Study the compounds and medicines.



    5. Use the information
    to create the

    correct medicine in the Mixing Area.'
